{"id":"6f5801e1935aec4c","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter.md","title":"ZFC Card Closed Unbounded Filter","display":"df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter — ZFC Card Closed Unbounded Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter — ZFC Card Closed Unbounded Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card-closed-unbounded-filter — ZFC Card Closed Unbounded Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\kappa,C,X\\in V\">\\(F,\\kappa,C,X\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (cofinality operation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardClosedUnboundedFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardClosedUnboundedFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 上使用，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a> 所定的唯一共尾度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardClosedUnboundedFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\in\\kappa\\land \\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land F=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid \\exists C\\subseteq X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard6ClubSubset}_S(\\kappa,C)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardClosedUnboundedFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\in\\kappa\\land \\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land F=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid \\exists C\\subseteq X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard6ClubSubset}_S(\\kappa,C)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The uncountable-regular hypotheses make the club family a proper filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-c